cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Code and data analysis scripts for: Fitting the Background Intensity in ETAS Models Using Regression-Based Poisson Point Process Models"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 'YYYY-MM-DD'
abstract: >-
  R code implementing a regression-based background ETAS model (ETAS-P),
  together with the classical kernel-based ETAS and ETAS-FLP estimators
  used as benchmarks, the simulation study, the application to the
  Italian earthquake catalogue, and additional analyses carried out in
  response to peer review. Accompanies the manuscript "Fitting the
  Background Intensity in ETAS Models Using Regression-Based Poisson
  Point Process Models", submitted to Stochastic Environmental Research
  and Risk Assessment.
